muew-preset 2
name Pluck
category Pluck
author MUEW Factory
tags short bright clean
desc Short filtered pluck; the envelope snaps the cutoff shut for a tight, clicky attack.
osc1Shape 2
osc2Shape 4
osc2Detune 0
osc2Level 0.4
filterCutoff 5200
filterReso 0.6
filterMode 0
amp 0.001 0.35 0 0.12
mod 0.001 0.2 0 0.1
lfo1Rate 5
lfo1Shape 0
lfo2 0.35 1
warp1 2 0
warp2 6 0
mseg 1 0 4 0 0 0.15 1 0.55 -0.3 1 0
routes 8
route 1 2 2.5
route 2 2 0.6
route 5 2 3
route 6 5 0.7
route 6 6 0.7
route 7 4 4
route 8 1 0.3
route 8 3 0.25
chorus 0 0.6 6 15 0.35
delay 1 0.22 0.28 0.3 0.18
reverb 1 0.35 0.5 0.15
